  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.120.1:\n- MAUI 10.0.120\n- `OpenMaui.Hosting` depended on whatever MAUI 10.0 was newest when it was packed\n- Children of a hidden view stayed hidden when it was shown (MAUI 10.0.120)\n- A CarouselView lost its bound CurrentItem when it got its handler\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
